{"segs": ["PA_ja_237:0.1", "PA_ja_237:0.2"], "en": "Jātaka: The Second Book of Birth Stories (Dukanipāta),", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_237:0.3"], "en": "Chapter on Sandals (Upāhanavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_237:0.4"], "en": "7. The Sāketajātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_237:1.1", "PA_ja_237:1.2"], "en": "“What indeed, Blessed One, is the cause that some individuals here—”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_237:1.3", "PA_ja_237:1.4"], "en": "“His heart is exceedingly cooled and his mind becomes serene. [The Buddha said:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_237:2.1"], "en": "“Because of our former association...”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_237:2.2"], "en": "Or through present benefit;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_237:2.3"], "en": "thus is that love born,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_237:2.4"], "en": "like a lotus in the water.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_237:3.1"], "en": "The Sāketajātakam, the seventh.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
